        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.) The University shall grant a Parental Leave of less than two weeks duration on any two occasions during the leave year. The University, at its discretion, may request that any additional leaves requested during this same time period be for a minimum duration of two weeks.",
